From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:10:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Guess audio track language from track titles and release
 names

Polish voice-over (lektor) and dubbed tracks very often keep the 'eng'
or 'und' tag of their source. TrackLanguageHints reads the track title
(Lektor PL, Dubbing, Polski, Deutsch, VFF...) and the release name
(PL.LEKTOR, PLDUB, [Lektor PL]) to give the real language.
---
 .../mediacenter/utils/TrackLanguageHints.java | 78 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../utils/TrackLanguageHintsTest.java         | 50 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 128 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/archos/mediacenter/utils/TrackLanguageHints.java
 create mode 100644 test/java/com/archos/mediacenter/utils/TrackLanguageHintsTest.java

